WEBVTT

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:12.634
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：Hoh… someone stepping out of the light. From the future, you say? Splendid — this is my Gifu!

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:19.350
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：I am a guest too. My lord's boasting runs long, I warn you.

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:25.680
<v You>You：Nice to meet you. It's an honour.

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:33.113
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：Look at this garden and waterfall. Even the southern missionary stood here open-mouthed.

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:39.644
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：Nothing pleases my lord more than showing off to guests.

00:00:43.280 --> 00:00:46.080
<v You>You：I'd love to see the castle on the mountaintop!

00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:50.996
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：Very well! It is a steep path — keep up!

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:58.776
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：…Behold. The whole Nōbi plain. From here I shall take the realm.

00:00:59.680 --> 00:01:05.562
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：The wind is strong… A fine view indeed.

00:01:07.680 --> 00:01:14.526
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：Let me make you tea — with my own hands. …It's hot.

00:01:14.680 --> 00:01:20.118
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：Oh, ice in summer… ice from the ice-house!

00:01:23.280 --> 00:01:25.880
<v You>You：So cold — it feels wonderful…

00:01:28.480 --> 00:01:32.000
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：Cormorant fishing! Here come the fire boats!

00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:36.092
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：Ha ha ha!

00:01:50.480 --> 00:01:55.566
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：Who knew fire and water could be so beautiful…

00:01:56.880 --> 00:01:58.880
<v You>You：…It's beautiful.

00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:05.923
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：…When the realm is at peace, I'd like us all out on the boats again, like this.

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:09.880
<v You>You：Yes — all of us, again.

00:02:10.480 --> 00:02:15.878
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：A gift for you. Let me stamp my seal: "Tenka Fubu"!

00:02:16.080 --> 00:02:19.080
<v You>You：…Thank you. I'll treasure it.

00:02:19.680 --> 00:02:22.013
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：Until we meet again.
